<div
  style='font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #eee;'
>
  <h2 style='color: #4A90E2;'>Welcome, {{name}}!</h2>
  <p>We're thrilled to have you join our community.</p>
  <p>Your account is now active. Click the button below to get started:</p>
  <a
    href='{{url}}'
    style='background: black; color: gold; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;'
  >
    Open the app
  </a>
  <br /><br />
  <hr style='border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin: 20px 0;' />
  <div style='text-align: left;'>
    <img
      src='cid:logo'
      alt='Company Logo'
      style='width: 100px; height: auto;'
    />
    <p style='font-size: 12px; color: #999;'>© {{ year }} {{ company }}.</p>
  </div>
</div>